<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ expenditure-based GDP falls 0.9 pct in Mar qtr.</title>
<headline>NZ expenditure-based GDP falls 0.9 pct in Mar qtr.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Monday released estimates of expenditure on real gross domestic product for the quarter ended March 31, 1997 (revised from figures in brackets).</p>
<p>Seasonally-adjusted percentage change from previous qtr at constant 1991/92 prices:</p>
<p>    March 1997	  Dec 1996		March 1996</p>
<p>    -0.9 pct	    0.6 pct (0.6 pct)   0.8 pct</p>
<p>Seasonally-adjusted percentage change from same qtr previous year at constant 1991/92 prices:</p>
<p>    March 1997	  Dec 1996		March 1996</p>
<p>    1.2 pct	     2.9 pct (2.1 pct)   1.2 pct</p>
<p>Actual annual percentage change</p>
<p>    March 1997	  Dec 1996		March 1996</p>
<p>    2.1 pct	     2.1 pct (2.1 pct)   2.3 pct</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
